  "lines": [
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "I've been telling AI everything lately. My schedule, my bank questions, even a work file. That's fine, right?",
      "board": {
        "type": "title",
        "left": {
          "icon": "chat",
          "label": "HELPFUL"
        },
        "right": {
          "icon": "lock",
          "label": "PRIVATE?"
        },
        "subtitle": "What not to tell AI"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Hmm, let's talk about that! Today: where your chats can go, what to never share, and some easy safer habits.",
      "board": {
        "type": "gallery",
        "title": "TODAY",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "💬",
            "label": "Where chats go",
            "cue": "chats"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🚫",
            "label": "Never share",
            "cue": "never"
          },
          {
            "icon": "✅",
            "label": "Safer habits",
            "cue": "safer"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Where do my chats even go? It's just me and the computer.",
      "chapter": "Where chats go"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Not quite. Your message travels to the company's servers. It can be stored there, at least for a while, depending on the service.",
      "board": {
        "type": "journey",
        "title": "YOUR MESSAGE'S TRIP",
        "traveler": "✉️",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "💻",
            "label": "Your device",
            "cue": "message"
          },
          {
            "icon": "☁️",
            "label": "Company servers",
            "cue": "servers"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🗄️",
            "label": "Stored a while",
            "cue": "stored"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Stored? Who sees it?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Depending on the service, chats may be used to improve the AI, and some may be reviewed by people. The privacy settings tell you more.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "YOUR CHAT MAY BE",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Used to improve AI",
            "icon": "brain",
            "cue": "improve"
          },
          {
            "label": "Reviewed by people",
            "icon": "user",
            "cue": "reviewed"
          },
          {
            "label": "Check the settings",
            "icon": "eye",
            "cue": "settings"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Okay, but it's not like it's posted online."
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Usually not. But accounts get hacked, data leaks happen, and shared chat links can be seen by anyone with the link.",
      "board": {
        "type": "checklist",
        "title": "OTHER RISKS",
        "icon": "warn",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Hacked accounts",
            "cue": "hacked",
            "ok": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Data leaks",
            "cue": "leaks",
            "ok": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Shared chat links",
            "cue": "shared",
            "ok": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Hmm. And on the family laptop?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Anyone using the same account can scroll back through your chat history. So sign out, or use your own account.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "👀",
        "text": "Same account = same history",
        "cue": "account",
        "sub": "Sign out, or use your own",
        "sub_cue": "sign"
      },
      "punch": "history"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "So the rule is..."
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Treat a chatbot like a helpful stranger online. Friendly and useful, but not someone you tell your secrets.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "shield",
        "text": "Treat it like a stranger online",
        "cue": "stranger"
      },
      "punch": "stranger"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "So what should I never type in?",
      "chapter": "Never share"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Passwords, and those one-time login codes. No real service needs you to paste them into a chat.",
      "board": {
        "type": "checklist",
        "title": "NEVER SHARE",
        "icon": "lock",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Passwords",
            "cue": "passwords",
            "ok": false
          },
          {
            "text": "One-time codes",
            "cue": "one-time",
            "ok": false
          }
        ]
      },
      "punch": "passwords"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "What about my bank stuff?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "General money questions are fine. But never paste card numbers, bank account details, or ID numbers like your passport number.",
      "board": {
        "type": "checklist",
        "title": "NEVER SHARE",
        "icon": "coin",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Card numbers",
            "cue": "card",
            "ok": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Bank details",
            "cue": "bank",
            "ok": false
          },
          {
            "text": "ID or passport numbers",
            "cue": "passport",
            "ok": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "So I can ask how a budget works, just not with my account number."
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Exactly! Same with your home address plus when you're away, or private photos. Those could be misused if they ever leaked.",
      "board": {
        "type": "gallery",
        "title": "ALSO KEEP OUT",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "🏠",
            "label": "Home address",
            "cue": "address"
          },
          {
            "icon": "✈️",
            "label": "When you're away",
            "cue": "away"
          },
          {
            "icon": "📷",
            "label": "Private photos",
            "cue": "photos"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#FF4D6D"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "And other people's info?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "That's their privacy, not yours to share. Don't paste a friend's messages, medical details, or phone number without asking them.",
      "board": {
        "type": "checklist",
        "title": "NOT YOURS TO SHARE",
        "icon": "user",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Friends' messages",
            "cue": "messages",
            "ok": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Medical details",
            "cue": "medical",
            "ok": false
          },
          {
            "text": "Phone numbers",
            "cue": "phone",
            "ok": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Now, the work file I pasted. Was that bad?",
      "chapter": "Work and health"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "It might be. Many companies have rules about AI. Use approved tools, and never paste secret documents or customer data into a public chatbot.",
      "board": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "label": "OK",
          "color": "#2ECC71",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Approved tools",
              "icon": "check",
              "cue": "approved",
              "tick": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "right": {
          "label": "NOT OK",
          "color": "#FF4D6D",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Secret documents",
              "icon": "doc",
              "cue": "secret",
              "tick": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Customer data",
              "icon": "user",
              "cue": "customer",
              "tick": false
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "What if I take out the names?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "That helps a lot! Replace names with Person A, remove numbers and addresses, and only share the part you need help with.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "CLEAN IT FIRST",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Names → Person A",
            "icon": "user",
            "cue": "replace"
          },
          {
            "label": "Remove numbers",
            "icon": "x",
            "cue": "remove"
          },
          {
            "label": "Share only what's needed",
            "icon": "target",
            "cue": "only"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#2ECC71"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "And health questions?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "You can ask what a word on a report means. But leave out your full name and record numbers, and check anything important with your doctor.",
      "board": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "label": "OK TO ASK",
          "color": "#0A84FF",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "What a word means",
              "icon": "bulb",
              "cue": "word",
              "tick": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "right": {
          "label": "LEAVE OUT",
          "color": "#FF4D6D",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Name & record numbers",
              "icon": "x",
              "cue": "name",
              "tick": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Decisions: ask a doctor",
              "icon": "🩺",
              "cue": "doctor",
              "tick": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "What about younger kids using it?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Same rules for everyone. Check the app's age rules, and kids should tell a parent if anything feels weird.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "FOR KIDS & TEENS",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Same rules",
            "icon": "check",
            "cue": "same"
          },
          {
            "label": "Check age rules",
            "icon": "calendar",
            "cue": "age"
          },
          {
            "label": "Tell a parent",
            "icon": "user",
            "cue": "parent"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Okay, give me the safety routine.",
      "chapter": "Safer habits"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Before you hit enter, run a quick loop. Read it, remove private details, ask if you'd post it publicly, then send.",
      "board": {
        "type": "cycle",
        "title": "BEFORE YOU SEND",
        "center": "💬",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "👀",
            "label": "Read it",
            "cue": "read"
          },
          {
            "icon": "✂️",
            "label": "Remove details",
            "cue": "remove"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🌍",
            "label": "Would I post it?",
            "cue": "post"
          },
          {
            "icon": "📤",
            "label": "Send",
            "cue": "send"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#0A84FF"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Post it publicly? Like on social media?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Right. If you wouldn't post it publicly, don't paste it into a chatbot. That one rule covers most things.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "lock",
        "text": "Wouldn't post it? Don't paste it.",
        "cue": "post"
      },
      "punch": "paste"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "And the settings you mentioned?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Open the privacy settings. Many tools let you turn off training on your chats, use a temporary chat, or delete old history.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "CHECK SETTINGS",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Training: off",
            "icon": "🔕",
            "cue": "training"
          },
          {
            "label": "Temporary chat",
            "icon": "⏳",
            "cue": "temporary"
          },
          {
            "label": "Delete old chats",
            "icon": "🗑️",
            "cue": "delete"
          }
        ],
        "color": "#8E44AD"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "And if some app asks for my password to unlock a better AI?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "That's a scam warning sign! Only log in on the real app or website you know. Never type passwords into a chat.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "warn",
        "text": "Password in a chat? Scam!",
        "cue": "scam"
      },
      "punch": "scam"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Quiz time! Question one. Is it okay to paste a one-time login code into a chatbot? Think...",
      "chapter": "Quiz",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "❓",
        "text": "Q1: Paste a login code?",
        "cue": "login"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Never! No real service needs that.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "x",
        "text": "Never!",
        "cue": "never"
      },
      "punch": "never"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Question two. You want help with a work email about a customer. What do you do first? Think...",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "doc",
        "text": "Q2: Work email help?",
        "cue": "work"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Remove the names and details, and use the tools my company allows.",
      "board": {
        "type": "checklist",
        "title": "DO THIS",
        "icon": "check",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Remove names",
            "cue": "remove",
            "ok": true
          },
          {
            "text": "Approved tools",
            "cue": "allows",
            "ok": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Last one. What's the one rule that covers most things? Think...",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🤔",
        "text": "Q3: The one rule?",
        "cue": "rule"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "If I wouldn't post it publicly, I don't paste it.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "lock",
        "text": "Wouldn't post? Don't paste.",
        "cue": "post"
      },
      "punch": "paste"
